  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_025) achieve high accuracy (0.6287). This experiment tests replacing avgpool aggregation (used in config_025) with transformer aggregation while keeping other components (pca_n2000 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, weighted fusion) consistent. This isolates the impact of aggregation method on performance, a critical design choice with sparse prior evidence. It balances exploitation of the promising multiprofile/imagenet_vit_l path with exploration of aggregation techniques."
}

